{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261123/photo/bkn-20261123222923039-1123_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261123230332\"/><p>愛東邨愛澤樓有單位失火。</p><p>筲箕灣發生火警。今晚(23日)10時10分，愛東邨愛澤樓17樓一單位失火，並冒出黑煙，街坊發現致電報案。消防接報趕至，發現單位內無人，遂破門入屋撲救，約12分鐘後把火救熄。事件中超過100人疏散，暫未有人受傷，起火原因有待調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T15:36:29.508112+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T14:29:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T15:29:53.501601+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T15:29:53.501601+00:00","content_hash":"967e19ee2df49dc11487d0c103f61b803d3bb19c9e38b7cc3685f23b10aff93a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}